              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SecondChernClassOfK3"}
              the second Chern class evaluates to 24:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
