            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory"}> F-theory
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory+on+K3"} F-theory on K3
          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p Original sources:
          %ul
            %li#Artin74
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Artin"}> Michael Artin
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supersingular K3 Surfaces
            %li#Weil79
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andre+Weil"}> Andre Weil
                , Final report on contract AF 18 (603)-57. In Scientific works. Collected papers. Vol. II (1951-1964). 1979.
          %p History:
          %ul
            %li#Dolgachev20
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Dolgachev"}> Igor Dolgachev
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Kummer Surfaces: 200 Years of Study
              %strong 67
              10 (2020) 1527-1534 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.07650"}> arXiv:1910.07650
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/noti2168"} doi:10.1090/noti2168
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.ams.org/notices/202010/rnoti-p1527.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.ams.org/notices/202010/202010FullIssue.pdf"} pdf
          %p Textbook account:
          %ul
            %li#BarthPetersVandenVen84
              W. Barth, C. Peters, A. Van den Ven, chapter VII of
              = succeed "," do
                %em Compact complex surfaces
          %p Lecture notes:
          %ul
            %li#Huybrechts16
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Huybrechts"}> Daniel Huybrechts
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Lectures on K3-surfaces
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.uni-bonn.de/people/huybrech/K3Global.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/HuybrechtsLecturesOnK3.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9781316594193"} doi:10.1017/CBO9781316594193
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Claire+Voisin"}> Claire Voisin
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2487743"} Geometry of the Moduli Space of K3 surfaces
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Morrison"}> David Morrison
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.cgtp.duke.edu/ITP99/morrison/cortona.pdf"} The geometry of K3 surfaces
                Lecture notes (1988)
            %li
              %p
                Viacheslav Nikulin,
                %em Elliptic fibrations on K3 surfaces
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1010.3904"}> arXiv:1010.3904
                )
          %p
            Discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/deformation+theory"} deformation theory
            of K3-surfaces (of their
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Picard+schemes"} Picard schemes
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Artin-Mazur+formal+group"} Artin-Mazur formal group
          %ul
            %li#ArtinMazur77
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Artin"}> Michael Artin
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Barry+Mazur"} Barry Mazur
              = succeed "," do
                %em Formal Groups Arising from Algebraic Varieties
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=ASENS_1977_4_10_1_87_0"} numdam
              %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=56:15663"} MR56:15663
          %p
            Systematic construction of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ricci+tensor"} Ricci flat
